Those can chew through
argument. Literally.

261
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:31,760
I'm surprised to see you move
so quickly on land. Not bad.

262
00:17:32,900 --> 00:17:34,620
Fur fish me, by the way.

263
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,080
Is that all you've got?

264
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:38,880
Tired old racism?

265
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,360
I thought we were past that.

266
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,720
Aw, I'm sorry.

267
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:53,560
By the way, there's something
I wanted to ask you.

268
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:56,940
Fire and fire!

269
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:04,320
Time to suffer, Jinbei.

270
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:08,560
Fragless!

271
00:18:24,760 --> 00:18:26,480
Fishman Jiu-Jitsu!

272
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:30,120
Low tide silver throw!

273
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:39,560
Water shot!

274
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:51,600
That hurt.

275
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,860
Damn, you're merciless.

276
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:02,037
Hey, time out, pal.

277
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:05,597
Can you give me a break
for just one damn minute?

278
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:11,377
There was this story I

279
00:19:11,460 --> 00:19:13,177
heard when I was behind bars.

280
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:18,057
Maybe you know it as I
was being tortured the

281
00:19:18,140 --> 00:19:20,857
guard mockingly told me
to pray for salvation.

282
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:24,377
Pray to the sun god Nika.

283
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:28,697
He's like a hero to slaves.

284
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:32,757
He was a legendary warrior who
fought for freedom in ancient times.

285
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:36,057
Prophesized to return and
liberate the enslaved.

286
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:40,217
I don't know if he really
existed but they say he would

287
00:19:40,300 --> 00:19:43,540
deliver folks from suffering
with a smile on his face.

288
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:49,120
It was a strange story but I held on
to it in those seemingly endless days.

289
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:54,117
Doesn't matter who just save me I thought

290
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:58,257
and what answers do you
hope to find from me?

291
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:02,900
I heard a rumor about some of
the Sun Pirates you used to lead.

292
00:20:03,260 --> 00:20:05,740
Quite a few of them used to be slaves.

293
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:14,480
The history of fishmen
is a history of slavery.

294
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:23,040
Turns out the guard who told me
about Nika was later executed!

295
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:28,157
I thought they might come for me next?

296
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:31,200
So I risk everything to
get the hell out of there!

297
00:20:38,200 --> 00:20:40,980
Is it dangerous to speak his name?

298
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:44,900
I can't help but be curious
What are you hiding?

299
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:46,010
Tell me

300
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:49,190
Spock!

301
00:21:04,520 --> 00:21:07,260
Fishman Toretti, sharp grip!

302
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:13,780
I have nothing to kill you!

303
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,480
Do you understand me?

304
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:19,580
What the hell?

305
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:21,820
I really struck a nerve, didn't I?

306
00:21:25,680 --> 00:21:28,540
I'll crush you, my pistol!

307
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,580
What's gotten into you?

308
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:49,520
Fishman Karate Secret Art! Oh crap!

309
00:21:53,220 --> 00:21:54,050
Hey!

310
00:21:54,133 --> 00:21:55,120
That's my tail!

311
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:57,480
Demon's Brick Chest!

312
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:14,909
You heard your mouth about this
like it's some sort of game!

313
00:22:15,860 --> 00:22:17,660
This is the weight of history!

314
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:19,320
You understand now!

315
00:22:23,040 --> 00:22:23,870
No!
